Tenun ships map data and place names made from these sources (see scripts/geo/SOURCES.md):

- Natural Earth admin-0 countries, 1:50m. Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data
  @ naturalearthdata.com. Public domain.
- geoBoundaries gbOpen, Indonesia ADM2 (boundaries of 2020). Runfola, D. et al. (2020) geoBoundaries: A global
  database of political administrative boundaries. PLoS ONE 15(4): e0231866. Source: Badan Pusat Statistik (BPS),
  World Food Programme, OCHA ROAP. Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 IGO (CC BY 3.0 IGO).
  The shapes were simplified, renamed to the current official names and codes, and joined into provinces.
- Codes and official names of Indonesia's provinces and kabupaten/kota: cahyadsn/wilayah, following the
  Keputusan Menteri Dalam Negeri No. 300.2.2-2138 and No. 300.2.2-2430 Tahun 2025. Copyright (c) 2025 cahya dsn.
  MIT License.

Maps of other countries' provinces are downloaded from geoBoundaries gbOpen when first used; each carries the
licence geoBoundaries lists for it.
